# exilemidan.faction — MIDAN PROPER after the ratified 2026-07-07 Midan/Black Fleet split.
# The pirate identity that used to live here (displayName "Black Fleet", makesPirateBases,
# pirate roster) was PROMOTED to exileblackfleet.faction. What remains below is Midan the
# shadowy manipulators. Identity remains minimally re-labeled, while the fleet block is an
# EXPERIMENTAL Persean League transplant (author-approved 2026-07-12) used to observe what
# kind of task force that roster produces before designing the final small elite Midan fleet:
#   - displayName Black Fleet -> Midan; makesPirateBases + pirateBaseStationTypes migrated out.
#   - Fleet-selection/doctrine fields are copied from vanilla persean_league.faction.
#   - Colors, ranks, portraits, music, custom behavior, and faction identity remain Midan's
#     stopgap content. This League-derived roster is TEST MATERIAL, not a lore ruling.
